---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<section class="-mt-6 pt-14 pb-12 sm:pt-16 sm:pb-14 border-b border-line">
  <!-- Eyebrow: small name + location. The work is the headline, not the name. -->
  <div class="eyebrow flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-2">
    <span class="text-ink">EE Heng Chen</span>
    <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-subtle">/</span>
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M12 22s-7-7.58-7-13a7 7 0 0 1 14 0c0 5.42-7 13-7 13z"></path>
        <circle cx="12" cy="9" r="2.5"></circle>
      </svg>
      Munich · CET
    </span>
  </div>

  <h1 class="mt-6 font-serif text-[clamp(2.25rem,6.5vw,4rem)] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] leading-[1.05] max-w-3xl text-ink">
    Built models that see.
    <span class="block text-accent">Now building agents that ship.</span>
  </h1>

  <p class="mt-6 text-base sm:text-lg text-muted max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
    Computer-vision researcher (PhD &amp; postdoc, 2018–2023) turned builder of
    LLM systems that turn regulation and review into structured, auditable
    output — deterministic decision layers, human-in-the-loop, evaluated.
  </p>

  <div class="mt-8">
    <a
      href={base + '/now'}
      class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-brand px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-on no-underline hover:bg-brand-hi transition-colors"
    >
      What I'm focused on
      <span aria-hidden="true" class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5">&rarr;</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
